---
source: crates/navree-orm/tests/relations/sql.rs
expression: "query(Team::query().where_relation(\"deals\", Deal::AMOUNT_CENTS.gte(1_000)))"
---
PostgreSQL: SELECT "teams"."id", "teams"."name" FROM "teams" WHERE EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "deals" INNER JOIN "users" ON "users"."id" = "deals"."owner_id" WHERE "teams"."id" = "users"."team_id" AND "users"."deleted_at" IS NULL AND "deals"."amount_cents" >= $1 AND "deals"."deleted_at" IS NULL)
  values: [BigInt(Some(1000))]
MySQL: SELECT `teams`.`id`, `teams`.`name` FROM `teams` WHERE EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM `deals` INNER JOIN `users` ON `users`.`id` = `deals`.`owner_id` WHERE `teams`.`id` = `users`.`team_id` AND `users`.`deleted_at` IS NULL AND `deals`.`amount_cents` >= ? AND `deals`.`deleted_at` IS NULL)
  values: [BigInt(Some(1000))]
SQLite: SELECT "teams"."id", "teams"."name" FROM "teams" WHERE EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "deals" INNER JOIN "users" ON "users"."id" = "deals"."owner_id" WHERE "teams"."id" = "users"."team_id" AND "users"."deleted_at" IS NULL AND "deals"."amount_cents" >= ? AND "deals"."deleted_at" IS NULL)
  values: [BigInt(Some(1000))]
